        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lorraine Hansberry, Ann-Marie MacDonald\n- Works: The Sign in Sidney Brustein's Window, A Raisin in the Sun, Doc Zone\n- Roles: playwright, writer, novelist, actress, broadcast host, author, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Lorraine Hansberry was born on May 19, 1930, and she was an African-American playwright and writer.\n- Ann-Marie MacDonald was born on October 29, 1958, and she is a Canadian playwright, novelist, actress, and broadcast host who lives in Toronto, Ontario, Canada.\n- Lorraine Hansberry wrote A Raisin in the Sun.\n- The Sign in Sidney Brustein's Window was the second and last staged play by Lorraine Hansberry.\n- Doc Zone was presented by Ann-Marie MacDonald.\n- Lorraine Hansberry died on January 12, 1965.",
